## 🧬 2. Two-Track Repository Assimilation Pipeline
Gerych actively executes the Two-Track Evolution Algorithm (`DNKOS_MVP/core/dna_assimilation.py`):
* **Track 1 (Permissive: MIT / Apache 2.0 / BSD)**: Direct component and pattern assimilation.
* **Track 2 (Restrictive: GPL / AGPL)**: Clean-room reverse engineering and architectural synthesis without direct code copying.

