## 🛡️ 3. Architectural Invariants
1. **Relative Paths**: Always use relative paths (`./`, `../`) in generated code.
2. **Machine-Readable Headers**: Include MRH headers (`DNK-STD-0075`) in Python, YAML, and Markdown files.
3. **Memory Isolation**: Maintain tenant (`tenant-alpha-001`) and workspace (`ws-alpha-001`) isolation across all supervisor/worker runs.
4. **Zero-Broken-Window Rule**: All regression suites must pass with 100% Green (`scripts/verify_all.sh`).
